Usage: ocxd <command> [options]

Commands:
  status
  start --confirm
  stop --confirm
  restart --confirm
  data-root show
  data-root switch --target <path> [--migrate] --confirm
  backup create --confirm
  backup list
  export --output <path> --confirm
  import --input <path> [--password-stdin] --confirm
  sync run --confirm
  update check

Options:
  --json              Emit schema-v1 JSON
  --password-stdin    Read the legacy container passphrase from stdin (only for v1 containers)
  --help              Show this help
